  "changes": [
    "Removed the legacy node:vm facade, registry capability declarations, require route, and stale builtin-list advertisement.",
    "Kept inventory path identities and hashes; eight mixed Buffer/util rows no longer cite the deleted setup facade as a product owner; the shape-only local node:vm fixture is excluded for the absent NodeHost builtin.",
